msgid ""
"You reached your daily quota of scraping request.\n"
"All your today's scrapes have been saved anyway.\n"
"\n"
"Start scraping again tomorrow.\n"
"Dont forget to select 'update' and not 'scrape all'"
msgstr ""
"You've reached your daily quota of scraping requests!\n"
"All completed scrapes have been saved.\n"
"\n"
"Try scraping again tomorrow.\n"
"Don't forget to select 'update' instead of 'scrape all'."

msgid ""
"Your share partition is almost full.\n"
"The scraper stopped automatically.\n"
"\n"
"Remove unused games, media, files to make room before running the scraper "
"again!"
msgstr ""
"Your share partition is almost full!\n"
"The scraper has automatically stopped.\n"
"\n"
"Remove unused games, media, and other files to make some room before running "
"the scraper again!"

